#In general: If the culture isn't listed, it uses the group values

#When priorities conflict, the _LAST_ item listed gets used; honorifics over landed titles.
#Hence, why government files are number _after_ culture files for priority precedence

#Cultures from CK2 that have _not_ been done:
- East Gallic, 

#General template for BP files

Priority Hierarchy
Barony - Mod Basic: 10
County - Mod Basic: 20
Duchy - Mod Basic: 30
Kingdom - Mod Basic: 50
Empire - Mod Basic: 105

Specificity (culture, government, &c.) should increment by one as applicable to create a hierarchy
Heritages should use the Base values

